# clusters. Runs on WSL: it needs the on-prem kubeconfigs, the AWS SSO
# profiles, corp GHE access and the VPN.
#
# EVERY cluster change here lands through GitOps or Identity Center. Nothing
# in this wizard applies YAML to a production cluster from a laptop. Where a
# live object must be touched because GitOps cannot express the change, the
# wizard says so, says why, and asks first.
