# The four gaps, each measured 2026-10-27 and each re-measured at stage 1 so
# the wizard never "fixes" something already fixed:
#   * risingwave-console on prod: RollingUpdate + a ReadWriteOnce PVC = a
#     rollout deadlocked since 2026-10-13, holding risingwave-onprem
#     Ready=False for 55 days behind an Available=True Deployment.
#   * prod's Helm charts float on .x ranges while QA pins exact versions, so
#     production is the least controlled environment of the three.
#   * argocd-apps reconciles on QA and does not exist on prod (41 vs 42).
#   * risingwave-console has no route on prod (6 hostnames vs QA's 7).
# Plus the Identity Center grant that lets a human use the SSO landed today.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

